Package: SPARQ
Title: Spatial Perturbation Analysis for Reliability Quantification
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Rahhul", "Elangovan", email =
        "rahhul.s.elangovan-1@ou.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Quantifies the reliability of spatial-transcriptomic analysis
        results under explicit spot-loss distributions. Provides perturbation
        support summaries, tolerance-based reliability certificates,
        anytime-valid adaptive stopping, retention frontiers, and cohort-level
        reliability inference.
